。基金が国民の負託に応え、真に効果的、効率的に国家戦略を推進していくものと…", "…しっかりと説明責任を果たしていただきたいというふうに思います。今後の基金の設置や運用の原則、基本ルールがいかにあるべきかということについて、…"]}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120405261X00220210125/28", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120405261X00220210125/31", "sentence": []}]}]}, {"date": "2021-12-17", "meeting": [{"meeting_name": "参議院 予算委員会", "remarks": [{"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/3", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/11", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/48", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/50", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/56", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/60", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/76", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/82", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/84", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/86", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/117", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/119", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/131", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/182", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/184", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/186", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/188", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/195", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/197", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00220211217/199", "sen